## Anthropic Implementation

### Available Models

#### Claude 4 Series (Latest - May 2025)
- `claude-opus-4-20250514` - Most capable (ASL-3 safety level)
- `claude-sonnet-4-20250514` - Balanced (ASL-2 safety level)

#### Claude 3.7 Series (Hybrid Reasoning)
- `claude-3-7-sonnet-20250219` - First hybrid reasoning model

#### Claude 3.5 Series (Current Production)
- `claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022` - **Recommended for production**
- `claude-3-5-haiku-20241022` - Fast model

### Basic Messages API Usage

```python
import requests

# Standard API call
response = requests.post(
    "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
    headers={
        "x-api-key": ANTHROPIC_API_KEY,
        "anthropic-version": "2023-06-01",
        "content-type": "application/json"
    },
    json={
        "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
        "max_tokens": 1024,
        "messages": [
            {"role": "user", "content": "Explain quantum computing"}
        ]
    }
)
content = response.json()["content"][0]["text"]
```

